# Hidden from ripgrep (and so from Claude Code's Grep and Glob tools) to keep searches small.
# The files are still tracked; search them with an explicit path when you need to.
# Claude Code's worktrees: whole copies of the repo, which would repeat every search result.
.claude/worktrees/
# Generated data: 580+ JSON files, some a single line of megabytes.
src/main/resources/processed/
# Raw geo sources (tens of megabytes of GeoJSON).
geodata/**/*.geojson
geodata/countries/countries.geo.json
geodata/**/wikidata.json
# Lock files.
**/package-lock.json
